;
; 4-bit free-running logic analyzer.
;
; One sample per cycle, straight into the RX FIFO via autopush; a DMA channel in
; write-ring mode drains it into a circular buffer. The state machine has no idea
; a trigger exists -- arming and stopping are entirely the CPU's business -- which
; keeps the sample stream perfectly uniform and the timebase trivially linear.
;
; IN base is the lowest of the four pins, so bit 0 of every sample is that pin.

.program la4

.wrap_target
    in pins, 4
.wrap
